LE(x,y) == x < y

LEMMA LE_trans == []ASSUME NEW x \in Int,
                         NEW y \in Int,
                         NEW z \in Int,
                         LE(x,y),
                         LE(y,z)
                  PROVE  LE(x)
    OBVIOUS

